# Copy to .env, which is git-ignored and never committed.
# An exported shell variable beats this file, so a one-off on the command line wins.

# Where the end-of-match report is mailed. THERE IS NO DEFAULT: if this is unset,
# empty or blank, the agent refuses to report rather than guessing a destination.
#
# For a real match this must be the address Appendix ו mandates (see
# project-book/appendix-f-binding-parameters.md, "כתובת דיווחי הסוכן").
# Rule 35 scores a report that never arrives as zero for BOTH teams, so a wrong
# address here costs the opponent their match as well as ours.
#
# Point it at your own inbox to rehearse the send path.
REPORT_RECIPIENT=

# HMAC key for the Step-0 hardware declaration (§9.3.3 wants it signed).
# Without it the declaration reads "signature": "unsigned" and attests nothing.
# Generate your own and keep it out of git:  python -c "import secrets;print(secrets.token_hex(32))"
STEP0_SIGNING_KEY=
